    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Unbiased Pareto is an API only family with two versions, both closed weights and without reasoning support. The newest, Pareto 26.10 Preview, offers a 1048576 token context and 131072 token maximum output at $0.8 per million input tokens and $3.2 per million output tokens. The earlier Pareto has a smaller 262144 token context, the same 131072 output limit, and higher prices of $2.5 input and $7.5 output. Both accept image and text input and return text. The facts suggest the family suits long document or image heavy work where a very large context matters, and the Preview version is the cheaper route per token. Limits include no open weights, so self hosting is not possible, no reasoning mode, and API dependence. The older version is both smaller in context and more expensive.",
